Package: @PKG@
Version: @VER@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: LibreDroid <adapt@lrd.local>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: libhybris, libhybris-utils, lrd-adapt-common
Description: LibreDroid device adaptation for @MODEL@
